# ============================================================
# Obsidian vault + ECE reviewer — ignore rules
# Notes, payloads, widgets and .obsidian config ARE tracked.
# What follows is only per-device state and OS noise.
# ============================================================

# --- OS / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# --- Obsidian: per-device window layout ---
# These change on every pane drag and will conflict on EVERY sync
# between desktop and tablet. Never track them.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/workspaces.json
.obsidian/cache/

# --- Obsidian: plugin state that holds credentials or device paths ---
# obsidian-git can store your GitHub HTTPS token in this file.
# Ignoring it keeps the token out of the repo and lets each device
# keep its own sync interval.
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/data.json

# --- Obsidian local trash ---
.trash/

# --- Node / build tooling ---
node_modules/
*.log
